6x^4+19x^3-51x^2+20x &= x(6x^3+19x^2-51x+20) \\
&= x(6x^3+24x^2-33x^2-56x+5x+20)\\
&= x(6x^3+24x^2-33x^2-33x-23x-23)+50x+20\\
&= x(6x^2(x+4) - 11x(x+4)-23(x+4)) + 50(x+4) \\
&= x(x+4)(x - 11) - 50\end{align*}
